        "original_id": "7e72bc7f-ac9b-55b8-9064-321da9a5a343",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ray Wilson, Billy Idol\n- Bands: Stiltskin, Genesis\n- Albums: Live and Acoustic, Rebel Yell\n- Songs: Eyes Without a Face\n\nFacts:\n- Billy Idol, born William Michael Albert Broad on 30 November 1955, is an English musician, singer, songwriter, and actor.\n- Ray Wilson, born on 8 September 1968, is a Scottish musician.\n- Billy Idol released the song \"Eyes Without a Face\" on his 1983 second album Rebel Yell.\n- Ray Wilson was the vocalist in the post-grunge band Stiltskin.\n- Ray Wilson was a member of Genesis from 1996 to 1998.\n- Live and Acoustic is Ray Wilson's first live CD release.",
